# Before anything leaves the machine: types, then every suite of what the push changes
# (and of everything depending on it) with every file at 100%, as CI checks on the pull
# request, then knip. It needs Docker running: it starts the services itself.
bunx turbo run check-types --affected --output-logs=errors-only
bunx tsc -p scripts
bunx tsc -p .claude/hooks
bunx tsc -p turbo/generators
bun scripts/push-coverage.ts
# Unused files, exports and dependencies (knip): quick, and CI fails on them.
bun run lint:unused
